In article <2jq0sk$k1a@nz12.rz.uni-karlsruhe.de> ne10@rz.uni-karlsruhe.de (roll) writes:
>Ok, my Barbarian Rolly is doing quite well so far. He is Level 9, has
>reached the Gnomish Town, converted the (once lawful) altar and
>is searching for corpses to sacrifice. But, ever so often when he enters
>the temple, a quite powerful ghost starts to attack him. I am the
>only one who plays on this machine and i don't remember any of the
>names of the ghosts. Also, when i enter the temple, i get the messeage
>'You feel a shiver running down your spine'. What does this mean?

The problem is that when you converted the altar, you had to kill the
priest. This means that the temple is now haunted. Every time you enter
the temple, the game checks a random number generator, and will print
one of :

You have an eerie feeling...
You feel like you are being watched.
A shiver runs down your spine.

... and 1 in 5 times, a ghost will be generated next to you. You are then
paralysed for the next 3 moves, giving the ghost a chance to hit you a
bit. The name of the ghost will be taken from the high score table or
from the following list:

"Adri", "Andries", "Andreas", "Bert", "David", "Dirk", "Emile",
"Frans", "Fred", "Greg", "Hether", "Jay", "John", "Jon", "Karnov",
"Kay", "Kenny", "Kevin", "Maud", "Michiel", "Mike", "Peter", "Robert",
"Ron", "Tom", "Wilmar", "Nick Danger", "Phoenix", "Jiro", "Mizue",
"Stephan", "Lance Braccus", "Shadowhawk"

To find out who they are/were, you'll have to read your FAQ, or ask
someone who's been playing hack a lot longer than me... ;)

